{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"The switchover temperature is **35°F (about 1.7°C)**. At that outdoor temperature and below, the natural gas furnace takes over heating from the heat pump.\n\nSource: [*ResStock Measure Documentation: Dual Fuel Heat Pump*, Section 1.2.1.5, p. 5](https://docs.nlr.gov/docs/fy26osti/96414.pdf#page=13), which states: “For this measure upgrade, the switchover temperature is also set at 35°F.”"}}
